And what's that person playing right at?

290
00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.000
Self-esteem.

291
00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.000
Self-esteem.

292
00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.000
They know what side the bread's buttered on.

293
00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:26.000
And they go right at that person's self-esteem and within 10 minutes they got them emotionally

