300
00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.000
I'm a good person.

301
00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.000
And that's how you have to work on it.

302
00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:57.000
The thing is I worked at Lafayette Clinic in Detroit, Michigan for a couple of years

303
00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.000
and it's mostly alcohol rehab and seizure.

