357
00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:56.000
Now you have a four-wheel-drive what?

358
00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.000
Hummer Jeep.

359
00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.000
Hummer Jeep. What's best in the snow?

360
00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.000
Not ice and snow.

361
00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:04.000
Four-wheel-drive, some big...

362
00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:08.000
You got a big earth mover, four-wheel-drive earth mover, okay?

363
00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:11.000
And you live three blocks from the school.

364
00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.000
And you say, okay, sister-in-law, I'll do that.

365
00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:17.000
You are being what?

366
00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:19.000
She is being dependent on you.

367
00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.000
You're being co-dependent because you'll say,

368
00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:25.000
oh, aren't I a wonderful brother-in-law for doing this, right?

369
00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.000
What if your sister-in-law calls you?

370
00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:34.000
She's got a four-wheel-drive all-terrain vehicle.

371
00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.000
She lives three blocks from school.

372
00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:41.000
She asks you to pick up her son and take him to your house.

373
00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:53.000
You have a Kia...Sophia with bald tires,

374
00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:56.000
and it starts every other time.

375
00:19:56.000 --> 00:20:01.000
It leaks oil, got no heat.

376
00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.000
You see what I'm saying?

377
00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:08.000
And you live 20 miles from the school.

378
00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:11.000
And you...What's happening here?

379
00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.000
You're being what?

380
00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:17.000
Manipulated because it is inherently dangerous for you to get in that car

381
00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:23.000
and go that distance when she could do it easily, safer, better herself.

382
00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:27.000
Whereas in the first one, it was safer and better for you to do it.

383
00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:30.000
Do you have to say, dependency and manipulation are similar.

384
00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.000
It's just the only way you tell the difference is,

385
00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:35.000
one, you're being asked to do something which is bad for you.

386
00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:38.000
That's manipulation versus something that's neutral.

387
00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.000
That's dependency, codependency.

388
00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:42.000
Can you tell the difference now?

389
00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.000
Okay, good.

390
00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:45.000
All right.

391
00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.000
How do you treat manipulation?

392
00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:51.000
You set limits and enforce them.

393
00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.000
So you start saying, what's your letter of order?

394
00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.000
No.

